Que vaut `x` à la fin ?
```c
int x = 5;
int *p = &x;
*p = 8;
```

Que vaut `*p + *q` ?
```c
int a = 3, b = 4;
int *p = &a, *q = &b;
```

Que vaut `p.x` à la fin ?
```c
typedef struct {
    int x;
    int y;
} Point;

Point p = {3, 4};
Point *q = &p;
q->x = q->x + p.y;
```

